  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\int_{-2}^{2}(1+2 \\sin x) e^{|x|} d x$\r\n$=\\int_{-2}^{2} e^{|x|} d x+2 \\int_{-2}^{2} \\sin x e^{|x|} d x$\r\n(Since, first function is even and second function is odd). $=2 \\int_{0}^{2} e^{|x|} d x+2 \\text{ instead of ,} 0=2\\left[e^{|x|}\\right]_{0}^{2}=2\\left(e^{2}-1\\right)$",
